One file watch per directory, shared by a server's registrations

DRAFT for the vendored eglot (D-108, D-111, O-61 (e)), revised 2026-10-15 (T-101):
against lib/eglot (github.com/emacs-straight/eglot c79f727 with
patches/eglot/0001). Not applied yet; to become patches/eglot/0002. A watch whose
directory was deleted (stopped) is forgotten, an invalid one replaced, and each
registration's handler runs under condition-case. Over 15 lines: Emacs upstream
would need copyright paperwork.

